flowchart LR
  A[NVRAM variable name] --> B[normalize name]
  B --> C[compiled nvram-set FSA patterns]
  C --> D[terminal and initial action combine]
  D --> E[Process profile evaluation and second combine]
  E -. caller profile and selected action unknown .-> F[Conditional approval modifier]
  F -. active approval and final status unknown .-> G[Final low status]
  G -. actual caller result unobserved .-> H[MAC result consumed by IOKit path]
  H -. separate boundary .-> I[EFI Runtime Services request]
